Package: midbrainType
Type: Package
Title: Automated Cell Type Annotation for Midbrain Single-Cell and Spatial Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Naz", , , "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Assigns cell type labels to single-cell or spatial
    transcriptomic data from the midbrain, using a curated marker gene
    reference bundled inside the package. No external atlas or reference
    download is required. Intended to be extended to further brain regions
    over time; this release covers the midbrain only.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    methods,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    SingleCellExperiment,
    SeuratObject
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/Notty4/midbrainType
BugReports: https://github.com/Notty4/midbrainType/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
